  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 33, 41); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">(126 fotos y un v&iacute;deo) S.F.M., de 19 a&ntilde;os, de Onda, permenece en la unidad de cuidados intensivos (UCI) del Hospital de la Plana, con pron&oacute;stico reservado, tras recibir un fuerte golpe contra la barrera del final de la calle Ecce Homo, donde le ha lanzado un toro de Adolfo Mart&iacute;n, en el &uacute;ltimo encierro de la Fira de este s&aacute;bado, patrocinado por la Junta de Festes. </span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefira18/img_9272.jpg\" alt=\"img_9272\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefira18/img_9273.jpg\" alt=\"img_9273\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefira18/img_9274.jpg\" alt=\"img_9274\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefira18/img_9275.jpg\" alt=\"img_9275\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefira18/img_9276.jpg\" alt=\"img_9276\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefira18/img_9277.jpg\" alt=\"img_9277\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefira18/img_9279.jpg\" alt=\"img_9279\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefira18/img_9280.jpg\" alt=\"img_9280\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousultimdissabtefira18/img_9281.jpg\" alt=\"img_